{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1384208401440714", "organization": {"id": "1384193674775520", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1384208401440714"}]}, "id": "1484528616839790"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1384208401440714", "release_date": 1791386880, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1459164257278461"}, "id": "1117305917438653"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1384208401440714", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1459164257278461"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "1459164257278461", "version": "3.3.0-rc.0-immuch360", "version_code": 3030038, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1793555101, "id": "1459200663941487", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v7", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 6, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1459203187274568"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1384208401440714"}, "id": "1459203187274568", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1384208401440714", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1962264594427836"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4523378011274627", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immuch360", "keywords": ["360", "VR180", "3D", "splat", "NAS"], "long_description": "Vos m\u00e9dias. Tous les \u00e9crans. Tous les points de vue.\n\nAppuyez sur 360\u00b0 et la photo ou la vid\u00e9o vous entoure. La 3D est en vraie 3D, le VR180 remplit une demi-sph\u00e8re, une photo spatiale Apple flotte devant vous, le reste se lit en fen\u00eatre ou sur un grand \u00e9cran mobile. Un film reprend o\u00f9 vous l'avez laiss\u00e9.\n\nNouveau et exp\u00e9rimental sur Meta Quest 3 et 3S : splats gaussiens (.ply, .spz) devant ou autour de vous, et relief IA, qui montre en 3D une photo \u00e0 plat, calcul\u00e9 dans le casque. Les sc\u00e8nes 3D et panoramas 360\u00b0 faits par Immuch360 sur ordinateur vous entourent, et chaque vue dit ce que l'IA a fait.\n\nMode kiosque (exp\u00e9rimental) : le casque ouvre votre film 360\u00b0 aux visiteurs d\u00e8s qu'on le met.\n\nConnexion : tapez le code du casque dans Immuch360 sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone.\n\nVotre drone (exp\u00e9rimental) : un t\u00e9l\u00e9phone Android sur une radiocommande DJI RC-N3 relaie son image en direct, en spectateur.\n\nVos fichiers sur place : le casque et ses dossiers, partages SMB, WebDAV et DLNA, t\u00e9l\u00e9phone ou PC de la maison, Plex Media Server ou votre serveur Immich. Fichiers bruts Insta360, GoPro MAX et DJI Osmo 360 assembl\u00e9s.\n\nLibre et gratuit (GNU AGPL v3), sans publicit\u00e9 ni statistiques. Les splats utilisent une API exp\u00e9rimentale du Meta Spatial SDK, que Meta ne prend pas en charge et ne garantit pas : tout d\u00e9faut est celui d'Immuch360.\n\nImmuch360, fork non officiel de l'appli mobile Immich, n'est ni affili\u00e9 \u00e0 Immich, FUTO, Plex, Meta, Apple, Google, Insta360, GoPro ou DJI, ni approuv\u00e9 par eux.", "short_description": "Vos photos et vid\u00e9os tout autour de vous : 360\u00b0, VR180, vraie 3D, panoramas et photos \u00e0 plat, lues sur place depuis le casque, un NAS, Plex Media Server, un t\u00e9l\u00e9phone ou ordinateur de la maison, ou votre serveur Immich. Les films reprennent o\u00f9 vous les avez laiss\u00e9s. Nouveau et exp\u00e9rimental sur Meta Quest 3 et 3S : splats gaussiens (.ply, .spz) et relief IA, qui montre une photo \u00e0 plat en 3D ; les sc\u00e8nes 3D et panoramas 360\u00b0 faits par Immuch360 sur ordinateur vous entourent. Libre, sans compte."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover-portrait-1008x1440.png", "id": "2295550251281113", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_2295550254614446_8889843587434163973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ukveTyGx_jwQ7kNvwFn2ePt&_nc_oc=AdphNDeVD0FLlACWPphrmkGUQqiMxNG_9ARBHhl19eQhptTkUbcGDGIZjK7L7GOjFOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0E9A2JhzXxm0l1OI2TRTIS-z8NoArL2rCIyoPlf5lsA&oe=6AF09CBF"}, {"file_name": "hero-3000x900.png", "id": "2005327380423208", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_2005327383756541_6618607123797567377_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wa2cXDy316MQ7kNvwEpwyPk&_nc_oc=AdrXiqEbOWQqXYA7DucKa_W_uCi_dn6NaPWiohG6yzDAYPdUTvPK5EYiR3_N6ow0pSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRv6vI6dD-NGgNYbc_ZsnvLbX3bsyvoxwU9nqnQZDszQQ&oe=6AF09104"}, {"file_name": "cover-landscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "1782845713042518", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307444_1782845716375851_4668112651399749545_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9J-2YQXagr4Q7kNvwGrSoYa&_nc_oc=Adohr6asq6Xy1WjkokL4BIpNgZwrSUIxYmXxsivdItjbxkDn4G30KA4Gm3Otvuaa-tE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStvKoybSx0QzQx13tl3vlPbSzoUyP35Nn9rS22zEY7CQ&oe=6AF0A6BA"}, {"file_name": "final_icon.png", "id": "1572972294132275", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1572972304132274_128435983103171379_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IG4rqSOW7l8Q7kNvwFTh9Dk&_nc_oc=AdqgocSbSEGvJ72TFXNqnxNr5M8x9pTBVyghL77poxMXJMTWb8ZszFNA4QgKEAxZDVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFPzN3CrGmIkHTzqX4uDecrcoM0R1i3DoWDSpWC5BtsQ&oe=6AF07E49"}, {"file_name": "cover-square-1440x1440.png", "id": "1426662259436279", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1426662262769612_6311685057863124741_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tASwkmkZ_uMQ7kNvwEXRiKA&_nc_oc=AdqtDHEzSCSJ1fAMvftqNa_VvoZI5x6KOdJtJe7VRToHmARRW1UP8Xu0dowOC6lVNXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCaNvSKU7Ps3mTmE1j7G0LoPGOuIeJVVCSx4hlHho5Og&oe=6AF07F5E"}, {"file_name": "logo-transparent.png", "id": "1161989966167586", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1161989969500919_329693315265702608_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lkE0ZILxrL0Q7kNvwF2RdiW&_nc_oc=AdrA46n2h4Yjtojp45Bq2HrVmyOh_qfClZmUTJxaem8se_45PUAzv9U_koxVzQI03HI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQREaSE0ElFfT1g-me6ShRu3rXl9mLnO-FQsvqoyypyfsQ&oe=6AF095EF"}]}, "id": "956222270875930", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01.png", "id": "2907512559608947", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_2907512562942280_4790508338452449229_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=73ADqC2rJMEQ7kNvwEbuFKk&_nc_oc=AdrrJXBHsWv7O9DaqoODrCwlvzQbAZ_y69KndmuXpgA8OD_V4-1HgO4mQigl4_4UT3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRwJbVpOpWJJCeeSEYA38vZUqnOv4CMEB0Q6ckuNgR8pw&oe=6AF091BC"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1114877094450423", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312267_1114877097783756_969857562965461489_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RIaVYpaFoY8Q7kNvwE9zmBP&_nc_oc=AdrEe62UvPiiUjgtMdRBjiedcgVDrdBVvyMlNIYsoNZWysWLy6lRYhyJcZ-s-MJ9Yeo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbCwVfPaiLVW054tPa1TV4jn4IKTi2X030_66B4GB2Fw&oe=6AF08E75"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "884131511361956", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_884131514695289_5808890142641071213_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rY2GQUWPPE8Q7kNvwFYTCUe&_nc_oc=AdqBObct6vR_n4dHOLq9n9EI2ZFzHiuXYgjyqcPl8roCWcpDAEGlbngGYWMhRYa3YfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYigOdjRCtDOv71FTxGWlp6qaJJh8aQc-bsPhYSqUOqA&oe=6AF0A559"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "2073705526623799", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313063_2073705529957132_5967704642211820566_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wcn8zZTf6FMQ7kNvwHQkk50&_nc_oc=AdoTJXZ6r3H3nPWS-xrO7ibxoEgIaezHyvVu-NyOO25WbQXt4myM5zRBwrdBrOY8Xkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_VZxLr2ID2-4ib2dZKEHEmMvZMHeGz6etoVP_I1zqHg&oe=6AF089E5"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1110048894841244", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1110048898174577_7636723964820635014_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mfzziKnzZUMQ7kNvwHddySX&_nc_oc=AdoUysEN_n2ymbkHfHFcpAPeJxo8_Hoz1vCVKWMUjMwmxsobYYBIddgWCXhFjlgArvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXZ_Dmu0xJsE3tQemMVxXD-le5snw0Ev23-J1thuIrsw&oe=6AF0880E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immuch360", "keywords": ["360", "VR180", "3D", "splat", "NAS"], "long_description": "Your media. Any screen. Every perspective.\n\nPress 360\u00b0 and a 360\u00b0 photo or video surrounds you. 3D files are in true 3D, VR180 fills a half sphere, an Apple spatial photo floats in front of you, and flat photos and videos play in the window or on a big screen you move. A film picks up where you stopped.\n\nNew and experimental on Meta Quest 3 and 3S: Gaussian splats (.ply and .spz files) open in front of you or around you, upright. AI relief shows a flat photo in 3D, its depth estimated in the headset. 3D scenes and 360\u00b0 panoramas made by Immuch360 on a computer open around you, and each view says what AI made.\n\nKiosk mode (experimental): the headset opens your 360\u00b0 film for visitors each time it is put on.\n\nSign in with your phone: enter the code the headset shows in Immuch360 on your phone.\n\nYour drone (experimental): an Android phone on a DJI RC-N3 remote relays its live video, to watch only.\n\nYour files where they are: the headset and its folders, SMB, WebDAV and DLNA shares, a phone or computer at home, Plex Media Server, or your Immich server. Raw Insta360, GoPro MAX and DJI Osmo 360 files are stitched in the headset.\n\nFree and open source (GNU AGPL v3), no ads, no analytics. Gaussian splats use an experimental API of the Meta Spatial SDK, which Meta neither supports nor warrants: any defect is Immuch360's own.\n\nImmuch360 is an unofficial fork of the Immich mobile app, not affiliated with nor endorsed by Immich, FUTO, Plex, Meta, Apple, Google, Insta360, GoPro or DJI.", "short_description": "Your photos and videos all around you: 360\u00b0, VR180 and true 3D, panoramas, and flat ones too, played in place from the headset, a NAS, Plex Media Server, a phone or a computer at home, or your Immich server. Films pick up where you stopped. New and experimental on Meta Quest 3 and 3S: Gaussian splats (.ply and .spz files), and AI relief, which shows a flat photo in 3D; the 3D scenes and 360\u00b0 panoramas Immuch360 makes on a computer open around you. Free and open source, no account."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/blob/immuch360/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "APROGSYS", "suppo